= Playtest Feedback — Stack M (Game Length Cut)

_One form per player. Fill out independently after the game._

#note-box[
  *Stack M is a bundled change — six things at once.* Board is *8×8*. Armor max is *2*. Injured pieces have *no penalty* (still 2hp tracker). *No draw conditions* — game ends only when a King is captured. Steal costs *4*. Multi-Champion Combo Bonus now also ticks on *movement-causing skills* (Tempest, Hook, Blast, Shove, Swap when it relocates an enemy).
]

#grid(
  columns: (1fr, 1fr),
  gutter: 8pt,
  [*Date:* \_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_],
  [*Game length (rounds):* \_\_\_\_\_],
