== B — Stack-Specific Questions

#fq("1")[
  *Game length — target was 30-60 minutes.* Did this game feel like the right length, too short, or too long?\
  Way too short — A bit short — Just right — A bit long — Way too long\
  How many rounds did the game last? \_\_\_\_\_ (also fill in Section A)
]
#v(1fr)

#fq("2")[
  *Game shape — single climax or up-and-down?* Did the game build to one big moment that decided it, or did it feel like multiple highs with lows in between?\
  One clear climax → game ended — Two climaxes — Multiple climaxes — No real climax\
  After the decisive moment, did the game end naturally, or did it drag? \_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_
]
#v(1fr)

#fq("3")[
  *Mid-game stalling — earlier playtests had a stretch where both players stacked Armor and nothing else happened.* Did that pattern appear in this game?\
  Yes, clearly — Briefly — Not really — Not at all\
  If yes, around which round(s)? \_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_
]
#v(1fr)

#fq("4")[
  *Board size (8×8):* How did the smaller board feel compared to the previous 10×10?\
  Cramped — A bit tight — Just right — A bit open — Too sparse\
  Did pieces feel like they had enough escape options? Yes / Sometimes / No
]
#v(1fr)

#fq("5")[
  *Armor cap (max 2):* Did Armor feel meaningful but not dominant? Did the lower cap change how you played?\
  Comment: \_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_
