#fq("6")[
  *Injured pieces — no penalty:* In this stack, Injured pieces still die after one more hit, but they don't slow down or lose Range. Did this feel right, or did Injured feel meaningless?\
  Right call (cleaner) — Mostly fine — A bit weird — Injured felt meaningless\
  Did you treat an Injured piece any differently from a Normal piece? \_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_\_
]
#v(1fr)

#fq("7")[
  *No draw conditions:* Was there ever a point where you would have wanted to call a draw but couldn't? Did the game end naturally?\
